Dental Desk is a clinic management product for dental clinics:
scheduling, patient records, visit history and a 3D tooth chart.

The application shell in `content/app.html` originates from a single-file
prototype ("Dental Desk") developed for Xoshimov Group. It was adapted for
multi-tenant SaaS use with a REST backend, authentication and role-based
access. All rights remain with the copyright holder.

